The full gate run is still in the 200,000-sample structure-aware guess test. Correctness, independent-reference agreement, and the compact-route cap have already held in the smaller audit; I’m timing this run because the measured sampling and baseline costs must be recorded rather than inferred.
diff --git a/gen_2604_18991.py b/gen_2604_18991.py
